# No database migrations in code

Never apply schema changes from the application. Do not add `_ensure_schema` or any startup/runtime SQL that `ALTER`s, `DROP`s, or otherwise migrates existing tables, columns, indexes, or constraints.

When a schema change is needed, change the SQLAlchemy models and give the user the exact SQL to run manually. Do not execute that SQL from Python.
